# The exact denial each document in ingress-peer-name-only.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
NetworkPolicy naranjo-online/cloudflared-to-naranjo-online widens the exact cloudflare-public TCP 8080 ingress contract
